Third-party material
====================

The Matribox II Pro model catalog (packages/core/src/matribox/models.json and
model-text.json) is our own work: a functional map of the unit's models (ids, categories,
parameter ranges) written by scripts/matribox-map.mjs, and our own model names and
descriptions. Names of real gear in it ("based on …") are trademarks of their owners, used only
to describe the sound each model aims at; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
them, nor by Sonicake.

packages/core/src/catalog.json, packages/core/test/fixtures/p34-payload.hex and
packages/core/test/fixtures/pocketedit-commands.json are copied from pocket-master-mcp (https://github.com/voronkovd/pocket-master-mcp).
The protocol implementation in packages/core/src was written from scratch
following that project's docs/PROTOCOL.md. Its license:

